 "headline": "",
 "intro": "A MULTI-WEEK INSTALlATION THAT PUT MOVIEGOERS IN THE CENTER OF THE ACTION WAS UNVEILED AT OUR EXclUSIVE INFLUENCER SCREENING EVENT",
