  {
   "title": "REACTION CONTENT",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>With so many great people in the room, we took the opportunity to capture and edit a special audience reaction reel immediately following the screening to use across MGM's social accounts.</p>"
